# Git kept warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every single file of every commit,
# twenty lines at a time, and PowerShell read that stderr as a failure and reported exit 255
# on commits that had worked. The repository is written with LF by every tool that touches it
# -- the Write tool, the mirror generator, PyInstaller's spec -- so LF is what it stores.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to normalise them.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.exe binary
